              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adzengi ariphomala kuika msingi wa nyumba ya kuvoya Mwenyezi Mlungu, alavyadzi-sadaka akpwedza na tarumbeta zao kuno akavwala mavwazi gao, na Alawi, yani ana a Asafu aima na matoazi ili kumtogola Mwenyezi Mlungu sawa-sawa na vira Daudi, mfalume wa Iziraeli arivyolagiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.10"
            ]
          }
